# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository.
#
# The same tree runs on both sides of the boundary: the host half is loaded by a
# Windows Node process, while `lib/wsl/terminal-bridge.py` is uploaded to and run
# inside the Linux distribution. Normalizing avoids CRLF churn in diffs and keeps
# the in-distribution Python source byte-identical to what was reviewed.
* text=auto eol=lf
